uote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1392310-mysteries-of-the-world-the-scion-second-edition-companion-is-out-to-backers?p=1392350#post1392350\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is this the one with Atlantis? Oooh. While I didn't back the kickstarter I am looking forward to seeing the material in this book, especially the section that pertains to Atlantis.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yep. It's awesome - the explicit thematic is &quot;science fantasy mythology&quot;; one gets the sense that the divine and science aren't really different things in the Atlantean view of things, and it informs their myths; yes, <i>of course </i>Badarus wants a starship, he's the God of <i>Shipwrights</i>. It's his <i>job.</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-28T17:56:32-07:00","id":1392370,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1392310-mysteries-of-the-world-the-scion-second-edition-companion-is-out-to-backers?p=1392367#post1392367\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yep. It's awesome - the explicit thematic is &quot;science fantasy mythology&quot;; one gets the sense that the divine and science aren't really different things in the Atlantean view of things, and it informs their myths; yes, <i>of course </i>Badarus wants a starship, he's the God of <i>Shipwrights</i>. It's his <i>job.</i></div> </div> </div> </div>Oh man, that sounds awesome. <br /> <br /> Right then, it means that I will no doubt buy this book when it comes available even though I don't currently own the Scion Core. <br /> <br /> I hope it going to backer's now means it will be available for sale as at least a pdf relatively quickly. <br /> <br /> Thanks for the info by the way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-28T19:20:45-07:00","id":1392388,"title":"","content":"Quick question: Druid is a Path or a Calling? If it\u2019s a path it\u2019s missing skills and have Knacks related to it, like a Calling.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-28T20:40:49-07:00","id":1392407,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1392310-mysteries-of-the-world-the-scion-second-edition-companion-is-out-to-backers?p=1392388#post1392388\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Quick question: Druid is a Path or a Calling? If it\u2019s a path it\u2019s missing skills and have Knacks related to it, like a Calling.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it's supposed to be a Denizen Path. Y'know, like Kitsune or Saint. So you've got to sub in a Path (pick three relevant Skills, since the sample Skills in the Origin Book I took as Suggestions rather than ironclad associations) and then take the Calling to use the Knacks. Like all Denizens.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":2142,"user_link